# Dwarven Mattock: the only Dwarf Bot1 controls is the target of its enters trigger (chosen automatically) and becomes a 4/4 with ward
# {1}. Bot2 has exactly two mana (Mountain and Mox Ruby): the Bolt takes one, the ward trigger asks {1}, Bot2 pays it with the other,
# and the Bolt resolves, leaving 3 damage on the 4/4 (the control for the scenario in which Bot2 declines). A ward {2} could not have been
# paid with one mana left. CR 702.21a.

